1698509124551625", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499310651_1698509127884958_3462372611220339303_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=QFf3yT6sVN8Q7kNvwGqFf2a&_nc_oc=AdqEbtIIkSMSVU9ePamMcEjv1JaR_-wRZZaITyB2e7cszbshbyb1XX8nmgqPMYFVnLA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQeGTOHB_iW71a4eh7VTdvvP1dNl9dqL0Yn1nXKIMRiMg&oe=6AE9FDAC"}, {"file_name": "86d4207caecc4bbba54c2c06e00924ae.png", "id": "1350772766999423", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499310651_1350772770332756_3815968784629696392_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=hjcy0_sGG8AQ7kNvwFf-731&_nc_oc=Adpc0A3GC-5b5WSOZIUHgarl2yLKprE6pejSV-qvnnEAUJQvwiI4io-XDzfB_zB49vQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRGimyX_CitLuWOlR2Tw7FFO_OaIkqyMlOsemiLuHx9bw&oe=6AE9E5AF"}, {"file_name": "b4d1876b8461495ba3309ffd05162fd9.png", "id": "1338667031556771", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/596068480_1338667034890104_7059448834119857994_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=zQ5W5FcUfpYQ7kNvwHARv9W&_nc_oc=AdpmWj1tlXTNK_VhD4hlJDW4sOqE4IZGWaJpsQlwo1QFihVUN11rl5b81H1NKZr3dbc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRFdchPTp2LBhqY136FPv4kYaLVUeUtausdwRZezJoagg&oe=6AEA0340"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "SGVRTrailerCover.png", "id": "1489970458990826", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499314641_1489970465657492_5101885299613120494_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=W8v6zlxFz50Q7kNvwGPvLxg&_nc_oc=AdrtTA67xMP8wH_sz-EBlMo2508V7pFbxYE2XXnhEjZDGysGLn6YYmCA2Yu5omLUwWc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRC82Z3cE-zs2gSD5KMEDJhMWdH2Y6GPq2jGzvuI0Yz5g&oe=6AE9FE5D"}, "display_name": "Singularity VR", "keywords": ["SGVR", "SingularityVR", "ClimberspaceStudios", "singularity"], "long_description": "\nExplore the Singularity.\n\nDeveloped by Yoda's Gaming Galaxy and Climberspace Studios, Singularity VR is a virtual reality experience designed to push the boundaries of immersive gaming. Whether you are stepping into a virtual world for the first time or you are a seasoned VR veteran, this game delivers a gripping, unforgettable experience built from the ground up for modern VR hardware.\n\nWe wanted to create something that feels as incredible to play as it looks. Through a passionate collaboration between our two studios, we have crafted a world that responds to your every move, drawing you deeper into the gameplay with every session.\n\nKey Features:\n\nBuilt for Immersion: Experience fluid controls, stunning visuals, and a world designed entirely around the unique strengths of virtual reality.\n\nA True Collaboration: Brought to life by the combined creative vision and technical expertise of Yoda's Gaming Galaxy and Climberspace Studios.\n\nEngaging Gameplay: Engage in competitive movement-based combat, or if you prefer a more relaxed pace, enjoy the atmosphere of Sector 1. Explore the vastness of space to experience true", "short_description": "Step into the Singularity, a collaborative VR experience built for immersion and exploration. Master unique movement mechanics, engage in competitive combat, or drift through the silence of space in stunning Zero-Gravity. Whether you are battling for victory or chilling in Sector 1, your journey into the Singularity awaits. Discover the next step in VR gaming today!"}]}, "developer_name": "Yoda's Gaming Galaxy", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://climberspacestudios.vercel.app/singularityvr", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://climberspacestudios.vercel.app/tos", "publisher_name": "Climberspace Studios", "support_website_url": "https://climberspacestudios.vercel.app/support", "website_url": "https://climberspacestudios.vercel.app/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035